CeruleanCity_Text_RivalIntro::
    .string "{RIVAL}: Hold it, {PLAYER}!\p"
    .string "The police closed the bridge to\n"
    .string "anyone who isn't strong enough.\p"
    .string "The ONYBRIS thieves went that way.\n"
    .string "I won't have you slow me down.\p"
    .string "Show me you can handle it!$"

CeruleanCity_Text_RivalDefeat::
    .string "Hey!\n"
    .string "Take it easy!\l"
    .string "You won already!$"

CeruleanCity_Text_RivalPostBattle::
    .string "{RIVAL}: Hmph. Not bad.\p"
    .string "The ONYBRIS took the TOURMALINE\n"
    .string "and crossed the bridge north.\p"
    .string "I'm going after them. Keep up if\n"
    .string "you can. Smell ya!$"

CeruleanCity_Text_OhRightLittlePresentAsFavor::
    .string "Oh, yeah, right.\p"
    .string "I feel sorry for you. No, really.\n"
    .string "You're always plodding behind me.\p"
    .string "So here, I'll give you a little\n"
    .string "present as a favor.$"

CeruleanCity_Text_ExplainFameCheckerSmellYa::
    .string "A chatty gossip like you…\n"
    .string "That thing's perfect.\p"
    .string "I don't need it because I don't\n"
    .string "give a hoot about others.\p"
    .string "All right, this time I really am\n"
    .string "gone. Smell ya!$"

@ RB translation: "Heh! You're no match for my genius!"
CeruleanCity_Text_RivalVictory::
    .string "なんたって！\n"
    .string "おれは　てんさい　だからよ！$"

CeruleanCity_Text_TrainerLifeIsToughIsntIt::
    .string "You're a TRAINER, too?\p"
    .string "Collecting, battling…\n"
    .string "It's a tough life, isn't it?$"

CeruleanCity_Text_YouCanCutDownSmallTrees::
    .string "Did you know you can CUT down\n"
    .string "small trees?\p"
    .string "That tree in the east pass could\n"
    .string "be cleared with CUT.\p"
    .string "I hear the captain of the S.S.\n"
    .string "ANNE owns the HM.$"

CeruleanCity_Text_IfSlowbroWasntThereCouldCutTree::
    .string "The police closed the south road\n"
    .string "and the east pass.\p"
    .string "Only the bridge north is open,\n"
    .string "for strong TRAINERS.$"

CeruleanCity_Text_PokemonEncyclopediaAmusing::
    .string "You're making an encyclopedia on\n"
    .string "POKéMON? That sounds amusing.$"

CeruleanCity_Text_RoadsClosed::
    .string "POLICEMAN: TEAM ONYBRIS is loose.\n"
    .string "We sealed every road out of town\p"
    .string "except the one to PYROPIA. The\n"
    .string "only way on is the north bridge,\p"
    .string "and only for strong TRAINERS.$"

CeruleanCity_Text_WantBrightRedBicycle::
    .string "I want a bright red bicycle.\p"
    .string "I'll keep it at home, so it won't\n"
    .string "get dirty.$"

CeruleanCity_Text_ThisIsCeruleanCave::
    .string "This is TOURMALIA CAVE.\p"
    .string "Horribly strong POKéMON live inside\n"
    .string "there.\p"
    .string "It takes a very special TRAINER to\n"
    .string "be allowed inside there.\p"
    .string "You'd have to be strong enough to\n"
    .string "become the POKéMON LEAGUE\l"
    .string "CHAMPION for starters.\p"
    .string "And, you would have to have\n"
    .string "made a great achievement.$"

CeruleanCity_Text_CitySign::
    .string "TOURMALIA CITY\n"
    .string "Where the forest grows crystal\p"
    .string "WEST:  ROUTE 4 (this road)\n"
    .string "SOUTH: ROUTE 5 (ladder below)\p"
    .string "EAST:  ROUTE 9 (past the dome)\n"
    .string "NORTH: ROUTE 24 (glass hall)$"

CeruleanCity_Text_TrainerTipsHeldItems::
    .string "TRAINER TIPS\p"
    .string "A POKéMON can be made to hold\n"
    .string "an item.\p"
    .string "Some items can even be used by\n"
    .string "the holding POKéMON in battle.$"

CeruleanCity_Text_BikeShopSign::
    .string "GLASS HALL\n"
    .string "RIGHT DOOR: NORTH PASSAGE\n"
    .string "(ROUTE 24)\p"
    .string "LEFT DOOR: CERULEAN CAVE\n"
    .string "(sealed)$"

CeruleanCity_Text_GymSign::
    .string "TOURMALIA POKéMON GYM\n"
    .string "LEADER: SYLVESTRE\l"
    .string "The Warden of the Forest!$"


CeruleanCity_Text_NorthPolice::
    .string "POLICEMAN: Halt! The bridge is\n"
    .string "closed. TEAM ONYBRIS went that way.\p"
    .string "Only TRAINERS proven strong enough\n"
    .string "may pass. Earn the GYM's BADGE\p"
    .string "from SYLVESTRE first.$"

CeruleanCity_Text_RoadsOpen::
    .string "POLICEMAN: The south road is open\n"
    .string "again. Stay safe out there!$"

CeruleanCity_Text_EastTree::
    .string "POLICEMAN: The roads are open\n"
    .string "again. Head south to APATIA.\p"
    .string "The east pass is blocked by a\n"
    .string "small tree. You'll need CUT.$"

CeruleanCity_Text_RefAsk::
    .string "DANTE: The river is quiet. Too quiet.\n"
    .string "Hunters set traps near the bridge\n"
    .string "and I saw them with nets.$"

CeruleanCity_Text_RefHunter1::
    .string "HUNTER: Rare ones fetch a fortune!\n"
    .string "Stay out of this, child!$"

CeruleanCity_Text_RefHunter2::
    .string "HUNTER: You beat my partner? Fine,\n"
    .string "I am not afraid of a ranger!$"

CeruleanCity_Text_RefGives::
    .string "DANTE: You saved the day. The post\n"
    .string "has a gift for you: BAGON!$"

CeruleanCity_Text_RefAfter::
    .string "DANTE: Take good care of it. The\n"
    .string "next REFUGE post is waiting.$"

CeruleanCity_Text_RefEarly::
    .string "DANTE: Not yet. Finish the earlier\n"
    .string "posts first. The KEEPER at the\n"
    .string "SAFARI ZONE knows the order.$"

CeruleanCity_Text_RefDone::
    .string "DANTE: Thank you again. The REFUGE\n"
    .string "is safer because of you.$"

CeruleanCity_Text_RefIdle::
    .string "DANTE: I watch over the animals here.\n"
    .string "The world is quieter now.$"

CeruleanCity_Text_CaveSealed::
    .string "The grotto is sealed by a strange\n"
    .string "force. Not yet...\p"
    .string "The hall's north passage is open.$"
